'''Ghosts''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2020 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2020|2020 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance ==
The blade is dark gray with a dull white aura with seven faint ghosts varying in different sizes imprinted on it, hence the name. The guard is light gray, and the handle is solid black

==Trivia== 
*It has [[Ghosts (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name. However, it is a rare instead of an uncommon.
